// Optional FoodData Central key. Leave this blank to use the public DEMO_KEY
// (about 30 requests per hour and 50 per day, per IP).
//
// The app target build setting USDA_API_KEY is what Info.plist reads as $(USDA_API_KEY).
// Set a real key there, or make this file the target's base configuration.
// Secrets.plist can also hold USDA_API_KEY. A blank value, DEMO_KEY, or YOUR_… is ignored.
USDA_API_KEY =
